  3
IEWS D-D AND E-E, SEE SHEET B4-9. FOR SECTIONS F-F AND G-G AND PEDESTAL DETAILS, SEE SHEET B4-10.\P4. THE SOIL REINFORCEMENT ATTACHED TO THE BACKWALL SHALL BE DESIGNED BY A SPECIALTY ENGINEER FOR A SERVICE LOAD OF ___ K/FT AND A FACTORED LOAD OF ___ 
  3
K/FT USING THE DESIGN CRITERIA FOR PERMANENT MSE WALLS. COST OF FURNISHING AND INSTALLING THE SOIL REINFORCEMENT IS CONSIDERED INCIDENTAL TO THE COST OF THE END BENT.\P5. FOR REINFORCING BAR LIST, SEE SHEET B4-11.\P6. PILE OFFSETS ARE FROM THE PGL, +
