\pxi-2.6,l2.6;1. TYP BAR AND STY ARE THE BAR TYPE AND HOOK STYLE OF STANDARD PLANS INDEX 415-001 (FY 2026-27): TYPE 1 STRAIGHT (B = LENGTH); TYPES 17 AND 18 STRAIGHT BARS WITH A STANDARD 90° HOOK (STYLE 3) AT ONE OR BOTH ENDS (B = LENGTH OUT-TO-OUT);
  3
 TYPE 11 U-BAR (B = BASE, C AND D = LEGS); TYPE 4 CLOSED STIRRUP (B = HEIGHT, C = WIDTH); STYLES 4 AND 5 = 90° AND 135° STIRRUP HOOKS.\P2. FIELD BEND OPEN STIRRUP HOOKS AS REQUIRED TO CLEAR PILE HEAD LOCATION.\P3. LENGTHS ARE THE MODEL CENTERLINE LEN
  3
GTHS ROUNDED TO THE NEAREST INCH; BEND DIMENSIONS ARE OUT-TO-OUT (SDM 4.3.10.C).\P4. VARYING LENGTHS: END BENT 1 5D1: 10 @ 4'-11", 16 @ 5'-0", 16 @ 5'-1", 4 @ 5'-2". END BENT 2 5D1: 10 @ 4'-11", 16 @ 5'-0", 16 @ 5'-1", 4 @ 5'-2".\P5. PILES AND THE CH
  1
EEK LUG WELDED WIRE REINFORCEMENT ARE NOT INCLUDED IN THIS LIST.
